Package: MxARMA
Type: Package
Title: Maxwell Distribution Modelling of Time Series
Version: 1.0.0
Author: c(person("Hintz Arthur H.", role = "aut", "cre"),
          person("Bayer Fábio M.", role = "aut"),
          person("Ramirez, Fernando P.", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Arthur Hintz <arthur.hintz@acad.ufsm.br>
Description: Implements autoregressive moving average (ARMA) models for 
    positive continuous time series based on the Maxwell distribution. 
    Includes density, distribution, quantile, random generation, and 
    conditional maximum likelihood estimation functions.
